        <tr>
        <td  class="rowalign" align="left"><strong>Job Description:</strong></td>
                      <td class="rowalign" align="left"> <ul class="ullist">
                          <li> Monitoring and ensuring smooth trading operations including Beginning of Day (BOD) and Ending of Day (EOD) activities.</li>
                          <li>Ensuring timely launching of new products and contracts.</li>
                          <li>Analysis of international markets and price trends in international markets.</li>
                          <li>Testing and implementation of new features in the trading system.</li>
                          <li>Coordination and ensuring smooth live trading from DR site.</li>
						  <li>Ensuring timely preparation communication of circulars issued by the exchange related to change in contracts, new products and changes in the system.</li>
						  <li>Ensuring adhering to the required service level standard for various processes related to market operations.</li>
						  <li>Providing timely data information to various regulatory authorities.</li>
                          
                          
                        </ul>
        </td>

